, "id": "7185582884799521", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982623_7185582888132854_5357891611076837602_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rjWPctycIzMQ7kNvwEPBVxD&_nc_oc=AdpxkvFz8l9Yp2gE3ZGP-JRwgZnSPGRHjxIGsPuzilqztfjX3iYenbFIcx_V2_LfnU0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSxPr-RHVfmXvbZnJSHnMlJOLrVY0fkDbkq7km2zzDlDg&oe=6B0B2C12"}, "display_name": "Santa's Conveyor Chaos", "keywords": [], "long_description": "December event is live! Read post below for details.\n\nHo Ho Ho! It's Santa here, and I've got a big Christmas challenge for you! My workshop's a bit of a mess, and presents are popping out all over the place, right into your house!\n\nYou'll grab gifts from moving belts and pack them as fast as you can. It's simple: gifts come in, you pack them up, and together we make sure Christmas is ready to go!\n\nThe game is easy to play but can get pretty zippy, like reindeer on a gingerbread sugar rush. But hey, that's part of the fun! It's all about quick hands, a sharp eye, and a heart full of holiday spirit.\n\nNo scores, no timers, just you saving the day one gift at a time. There's also a personal gift shop for you to treat yourself to some home decoration, like a lovely Christmas tree! So, what do you say? Grab your Quest and make some room,  let's see those present-packing skills in action!\n\nCheers and chuckles,\nSanta \ud83c\udf85\u2728", "short_description": "Ho Ho Ho! It's Santa here, and I've got a big Christmas challenge for you! My workshop's a bit of a mess, and presents are popping out all over the place, right into your house!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://privacy.fieldof.vision/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Field Of Vision", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://fieldof.vision/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "conte